OL,3,GNEWSATributes to former Labour MSP
OL,4,ACathie Craigie who died after short
OL,5,Aillness
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister John Swinney has led
OL,8,Ftributes to former MSP Cathie Craigie
OL,9,Ffollowing her death on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Labour MSP represented
OL,12,FCumbernauld and Kilsyth between 1999
OL,13,Fand 2011.
OL,15,FIn a social media post, Swinney said:
OL,16,F"Very sorry to hear the sad news of the
OL,17,Fdeath of former Labour MSP Cathy
OL,18,FCraigie. She was a kind and generous
OL,19,Fcolleague. My condolences to her
OL,20,Ffamily."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
